-        b.  Determine the slab thickness parameter $d$ (where the physical slab thickness is $2d$) [S2].
-        c.  Perform a texture lookup in the pre-integration table using $(s_f, s_m, s_b)$ as coordinates [S2].
-            *   If using the 3D table: Fetch $(C_{slab}, \alpha_{slab})$ directly [S2].
-            *   If using the 2D table: Fetch $(C_{slab}, \alpha_{slab})$ using $(s_f, s_b)$ [S3].
-        d.  Update the accumulators using the front-to-back compositing equation [S2]:
-            $$
-            C_{acc} \leftarrow C_{acc} + (1 - \alpha_{acc}) C_{slab}
-            $$
-            $$
-            \alpha_{acc} \leftarrow \alpha_{acc} + (1 - \alpha_{acc}) \alpha_{slab}
-            $$
